
                          ZEd - Zeus' Line Editor
                         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
            Written by Alex May (c)1992-1995 Zeus Developments

Installation

 1> Copy ZEd to 'Doors:'

 2> Run Zeus:Prefs/Editors

 3> Click on Add

 4> Name        : 'Zeus Line Editor'
    Low Access  : 0
    High Access : 255
    Usage       : Both

 5> Click on Edit Scripts

 6> Enter this data

--- Cut along dotted line ---
#MSG

ZDoor '"ZEd 'Line' T:MsgText.'Line'"'

#FILE

ZDoor '"ZEd 'Line' T:FileDesc.'Line'"'

--- End of clip ---

 7> Click on Ok and then Save

 8> Run 'UpdateConfigs EDITORS'


Usage

   ZDoor '"ZEd <Line Number> <Filename> [MAXLINES x] [WIDTH x]"'

   As you can see, you can set the maximum number of lines the finished
file will contain and the width of the text.  These are handy for
Signatures or File Description editing.

